title: "Governed AI Code Security"
type: software
version: 0.1.2
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: Apache-2.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23819790
repository-code: "https://github.com/gusedugousa/governed-ai-code-security"
abstract: >-
  Proof-of-concept platform for governed, AI-assisted source-code security analysis.
  It combines specialized security scanners with LLM agents orchestrated by LangGraph,
  and integrates into continuous integration through a severity gate and SARIF output.
  It is a partial demonstration extracted from a broader, unpublished implementation.
authors:
